<title>CHINA: HK provisional Apr-Jun unemployment 2.4 pct.</title>
<headline>HK provisional Apr-Jun unemployment 2.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's Census and Statistics Department gave the following seasonally adjusted figures on Friday as percentages of the total workforce:</p>
<p>			Apr-Jun*  Mar-May   Dec-Feb   Mar-May</p>
<p>			 1997	1997     1996/97    1996</p>
<p> Unemployment	2.4	 2.5	 2.4	 3.2</p>
<p> Underemployment   1.2	 1.3	 1.2	 1.9</p>
<p>* = provisional</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
